<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50, instances $1.00 higher. Demand was moderate to good. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 51.00-52.50, few early 50.50, few late</p>
<p>	     53.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $1.00-2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-400 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>	     400-500 lbs. 42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	     500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	     few over 600 lbs. 48.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
</text>
